<title>USA: CBOT rice closes higher on short covering.</title>
<headline>CBOT rice closes higher on short covering.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Short covering, tied to signals the market was oversold, boosted CBOT rice futures to a higher close, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;The market rallied on oversold ideas and short covering,&quot; a trader said.</p>
<p>November early hit a session low of $9.65 per cwt, a chart support level and selling waned at that area, they said.</p>
<p>Rice closed three to eight cents per cwt higher, with November up three at $9.78 per cwt.</p>
<p>Sam Nelson 312-408-8721</p>
